/nox
# Binaries from `go build ./cmd/<name>`, which writes to the working directory.
# /nox was listed but each new command needed its own line, and one was missed:
# an 8.9 MB darwin/arm64 binary reached main. Cover them by pattern instead.
/registry-sync
/marketplace-build

